\n&nbsp;

This Hand Roll Set is the perfect beginners set when learning how to roll. Included is all the needed materials to make rolling a simple task. This sets includes a metal tray, plastic grinder, funnel, rolling paper and cone maker. Make rolling perfect joints with this hand roll set.
